  "notable_quotes": [
    "The authors propose halogen bonding is close to enabling permanently porous halogen-bonded organic frameworks (XOFs) as a new class of materials.",
    "The paper argues halogen bonding is a largely untapped route to low-density porous architectures with large, highly crystalline domains.",
